# Ends the run.
#
# Nothing in this file uses addon syntax, so it also runs when the addon is the thing that broke, and
# the verify task reads the marker as the point after which the log is complete. Ten seconds is enough
# for every `on load` trigger above to have run and logged its detail line.

every 10 seconds:
    log "XIAOJIE_SELFTEST=STOPPED"
    stop the server
